'''You must now follow [[Boridain Glacierbane]] around and keep him alive while he hunts for the [[Rabid Tundra Kodiak]]. He will go to certain dangerous locations such as the giant fort, the prison camp, and the Ry'gorr fort, before finally encountering the [[Rabid Tundra Kodiak]]. You must protect him from any aggressive monsters en route, as well as from any static spawns he finds in these locations. This event has a fair bit of intricacies so see [[Boridain Glacierbane Escort Guide]] for more info.


